############################################################
### 6-1b) AI Summary — GPT-4o LLM Scoring + Patient Summary
###
### Guille's ai_pipeline integration:
###   - GPT-4o scores each sentence's clinical relevance (0-5)
###   - Extracts actual risk numbers (e.g., "24-25%", "13 years")
###   - Reformats into patient-facing plain language
###   - Runs as Step 11 in pipeline_runner.py (after Step 10 DB save)
###   - Results stored in llm_domain_scoring_and_summary table
###
### Response fields:
###   domain          - cp/le/ed/inc/ius
###   ai_score        - 0-5 (0=not mentioned, 5=patient-specific with timeline)
###   extracted_estimate - the actual risk number (e.g., "24-25%")
###   treatment       - "surgery"/"radiation"/null (side-effect domains only)
###   source_sentence - original doctor's sentence used to generate summary
###   source_context  - surrounding context sentences
###   reformat_sentence - patient-facing AI summary
###
### Usage in app:
###   Patient First Visit / Follow-up → "AI-Generated Summary" section
###   "View relevant sentences" → shows source_sentence
############################################################

### List all patients with AI-generated summaries
GET {{base}}/api/patient/ai-summary
X-API-Key: {{api_key}}

###
### Get AI summary for specific patient (SID-10)
### Returns per-domain: ai_score, extracted_estimate, source_sentence, reformat_sentence
GET {{base}}/api/patient/ai-summary/Input_Keystrokes REC 001 (SID 10).xlsx
X-API-Key: {{api_key}}

###
### Get AI summary for specific patient (SID-14)
### If AI summary not available, returns source="fallback_rewriter" with empty domains
GET {{base}}/api/patient/ai-summary/Input_Keystrokes REC001 (SID 14).xlsx
X-API-Key: {{api_key}}


